  "body": "**Stacked on #120** (issue #85; itself stacked on #118, issue #80). Before #120 merges, retarget this PR to `main`; merge order #118 -> #120 -> this.\n\nDrilling reads the stock the setup's earlier operations left (issue #89).\n\n**What changed**\n- New `crates/app/src/operation/drill_prior.rs`: a `PriorCell` simulates #96's `rest::PriorPlan` lazily, once per job - the Drill arm builds it only when `axial_reach` against raw stock refuses; verify's #96 acquittal shares the same cell.\n- Reach depth, R-plane law and holder check read min(raw stock, prior surface) over the tool's (holder's) disc, at the highest covered cell (`verify::prior_surface` made public); a counterbore an earlier op cut reads as air.\n- Lathe axial drills read the grid revolved about the axis (lowest of four compass cells per ring, highest ring); `PriorPlan::simulate` cuts turning tools as a nose-radius ball (stricter #96 acquittal on lathes).\n- Unknown (ungenerated) or tilted removal = raw stock. Cross drills stay on raw stock (the column grid can't be read along a radial hole line).\n- Drill's stamp carries the ahead-ops digest - a drill goes Stale when an op ahead changes; `posting::a_stale_operation_blocks_the_post_and_leaves_the_file_untouched` regenerates in program order.\n\n**Pinned by** `drill_prior::{a_hole_on_a_pocket_floor_an_earlier_op_cleared_posts, face_then_drill_with_r_at_the_faced_height_posts, a_lathe_axial_drill_after_facing_posts, a_shallower_earlier_pocket_makes_the_drill_stale, the_same_hole_with_nothing_ahead_is_still_refused, drill_first_with_r_under_the_unfaced_stock_is_still_refused, a_lathe_axial_drill_before_facing_is_refused, an_ahead_op_that_never_cut_leaves_the_raw_reading}`.\n\n**Gates**: drill_prior 8, drill_reach, drill_reach_fit, drill_rplane, drilling_axial, drilling_cross*, lathe_cross_drill, vertical_rapid_stock, remachining, posting, operations, conformance, golden_cl - green; clippy clean.\n\n**Gap**: lathe Facing faces the part model, not a stock allowance - issue #122 (the lathe test models the allowance on the part).\n\nChangelog: fix(app): drilling reads the stock the setup's earlier operations left - a hole on a pocket floor, an R plane on a faced top (mill and lathe axial) and the holder check credit the earlier removal; unknown or tilted removal reads as raw stock; a drill goes Stale when an op ahead of it changes\n\nFixes #89\n",
